WEBVTT

00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:01.840
Translation by Zena.

00:02:10.639 --> 00:02:11.959
*MENACING

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:16.800
Jiang Haoyi!

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:18.160
We're breaking up!

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:20.320
The hell is wrong with you!?

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:24.000
Fine by me!

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.000
Like I would regret that!

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:25.920
Let tell you one thing.

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:27.920
With that attitude of yours-

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:29.880
No one will like you!

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:39.000
That's a really a sight of going crazy...

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:43.200
What did you just eat?

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:44.679
I haven't seen you in just a few minutes-

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:45.480
You sure have gotten fatter.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.000
I got punched out of nowhere.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:49.800
And got forced to break up!

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:52.040
Although this relationship is made up by her-

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.000
But for a girl to take the infinitive...

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.680
It really pisses me off!

00:02:56.840 --> 00:02:57.560
Beak up...

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:00.120
If I just break up with everyone.

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:01.520
Won't the problem be solved?

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.880
Looks like you really don't understand women...

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.480
When most women said let's break up-

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:07.460
It's actually a Warning signal.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:08.480
Are you kidding me?

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:10.960
Warning Signal...

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:12.519
She...

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:16.280
End her own life?!

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:37.880
I can't hold it anymore!

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:39.720
Don't stop until 1000!

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.560
Loser must know their place!

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:43.740
Who ask you guys to lose to our female group.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:45.960
Pez!

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:46.840
(Nice chance to grab leg eh)

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.120
Please spare us!

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.520
We will never underestimate women again!

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:51.880
Spare you guys?

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:54.720
Squad down now!

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:56.320
No one is going home until you all finishes!

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:57.840
Bunch of useless fools!

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.840
She really is not a normal girl.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.020
She sure can bounce back from being heart broken fast.

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:03.840
No...

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:05.560
If this goes on, someone might die.

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:07.120
I have to save those guys.

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.280
Remember, you're vulnerable.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:11.900
Squad down!

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:17.719
It's just a bet.

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.760
Don't need to force them to this extend, right?

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:20.900
Why are you here for.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:22.640
Didn't I make myself clear?

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:24.880
Savior's here!

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:26.940
Still doing that?

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:28.440
Haven't you had enough?!

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:29.920
Asshole!

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:30.760
LET GO!

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:32.119
No!

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:48.000
Oh no oh no!

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:50.560
I'll get murdered!

00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:57.240
You're really persistence huh...

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:58.960
Jiang Haoyi...

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.479
I finally know why you had a affair.
(Note: The reason is much more complicated, This is most easy for you noobies to understand.

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:04.120
Ass...hole!

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:08.520
Oh bro, thanks for arriving in time!

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.220
Or else we would could've died.

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:12.880
But, just now big sister's attitude is abnormal.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:13.800
She didn't do anything.

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.680
Thinking about it that is quite scary...

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:39.580
Jiang Haoyi...

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:45.440
Haoyi!

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:52.520
Jiang Haoyi-

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.240
You son of a bitch...

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.620
You don't know how much my love is for you...

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:07.599
It's over...

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:16.400
Tomorrow...

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:18.400
It's a new start...

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:23.920
Haoyi.

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:25.060
Time to wake up.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:26.840
Didn't you say you're going out?

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:31.960
I'M LATE!

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:35.760
Xueli!

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:36.880
What are you doing on my bed for?!

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:38.140
( ͡°╭͜ʖ╮͡° )

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:39.520
You're awake.

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:43.099
Today's weekend.

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:44.480
Why are you going out in such a rush.

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:46.080
N-n-n-no-noo-nooo

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:47.719
You're going to a date, right?

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:49.599
W-what?

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:51.200
I'm just going to buy some refence books.

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:52.600
The one that's needed for essay.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:53.600
Y-you forgot...?

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:55.599
Oh really...

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:58.760
EY XUELI!!!

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.000
WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU DOING?!

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:02.700
It's locked for real!

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:05.440
Don't tell me my first date-

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.420
Will be spend with me being confined in my own room?!

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:09.400
LET ME OUT!!!

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:10.179
DAD! MOM!

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:12.400
PLEASE DO SOMETHING ABOUT XUELI!

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:13.440
Dear.

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:16.000
Today you'll be staying at home.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:17.840
Where's Haoyi.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.640
Haoyi said he wants to study at home.

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:22.440
Not going out anymore.

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:24.000
I'm going to help him buy the books now.

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:24.760
Uncle, Auntie.

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:25.920
Please don't open the door for him.

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:27.200
Tian Ming.

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:28.380
Our son has been bullied-

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:29.120
Aren't going to do something?

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:32.520
Isn't that good? Someone is taking care of our son.

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:35.480
HA?! Why don't you like it when Tong Yun takes care of you back than!

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:37.760
This tea is good...

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:38.800
DON'T CHANGE THE SUBJECT!

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:40.719
Open the door ahhhh...

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:47.480
Y-yueyue

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:51.599
Yueyue...

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:54.080
Can brother use your house door?

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:59.760
T-THE NEXT DOOR PERVERT BROTHER CAME!!!

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.140
EY! I'M NOT A PERVERT!

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:02.200
Good Yueyue!

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:02.760
Stop screaming!

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:04.400
I will buy sweets for you when I come back!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:23.560
Understand now?

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:26.099
Jiang Haoyi is mine.

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:30.360
This is the so call childhood friend...

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:33.539
Haoyi...

00:08:33.539 --> 00:08:34.860
Today's date-

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:36.940
Let's make it our end...

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:40.720
Sorry, kept you waiting...

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:42.200
Family problems.

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:45.280
N-no problem...

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:47.780
I didn't wait long...

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:52.480
H-how about...

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:54.360
We drink something first...

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:54.860
(Don't get any funny idea you pervs)
┬┴┬┴┤ ͜ʖ ͡°) ├┬┴┬┴

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:02.780
Calling me out...

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:04.439
Isn't it just for some Coffee...

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:15.680
Haoyi.

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:16.839
There's some words...

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:18.640
I've been keeping inside my heart.

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:21.200
Please accept my feelings.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:23.760
I understand your sincere.

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:24.920
Zi Tong.

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:26.979
I will consider about it.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.719
Suppose to be like this...

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:34.680
Should I say something...?

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:36.720
What should I say...

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:39.280
This is the first time I'm on a date with a boy...

00:09:39.480 --> 00:09:41.440
My heart is about to bust out...

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.080
If this goes on I-

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:45.080
Why is your face so red.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:46.360
Are you sick?

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:54.160
I

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:57.319
I'm fine...

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:09.840
We barely said anything...

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.200
We're already dying of awkwardness...

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:13.960
I'm really not suitable for love...

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:18.160
Anime festival...

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:19.560
How could I forgotten about that.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:20.560
Thank god  heaven is on my side.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:23.280
Uh, that.

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:24.640
Today is Anime festival.

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:25.699
Let's go.

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:33.920
I'm back~

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:44.640
Good huh, My Dear...

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:46.640
You want to play hide and sneak...

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:47.880
Then...

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:49.720
Excuse me...

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:00.959
Girls! Please look this way!

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:03.280
Say, this competition.

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:05.120
Who can still compete with us.

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:07.720
I would say is Number 16 and 19...

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:09.320
Don't worry about 19.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:10.540
About 16...

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:12.160
She's alone this year.

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:13.400
Didn't even have a group at all.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:14.800
No matter how good the costume is-

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.000
What's the point.

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:16.920
Yea.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.520
Pretty girl!

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:36.200
I'm so useless!

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:38.880
If you want to hold, hold!

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:39.820
Why back out?

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:41.400
Don't tell me I have to take the initiative?

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:43.660
This awkwardness kinda motivates me to do so...

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:44.420
Xuanxuan!

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:55.600
Careful!

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:02.280
It can't be!

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:06.680
You guys are too excited~

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:09.400
I-I'm not that cute at all-

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:11.980
IT'S YOU!

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:24.960
Translation by Zena.

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:38.720
Edited by Zena.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:55.400
Timing by Zena.

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:13.100
真是的... 我不對不起我延遲, 但是!

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:16.980
明日！ 俺は最終の波紋は取り出す!

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:20.800
Just you wait bitches!
